ult-content":"Binance par register karein aur apna inaam claim karne ke liye shnakht ki tasdeeq mukammal karein","binance_academy_disclaimer":"Cryptocurrency trading mein high market risk mojud hota hai. Barah e karam apni trades ahtiyat ke sath karein. Aap apne trading losses ke liye khud zimmedar hain. Binance high-quality projects ke sath partnership karne ki koshish karta hai, lekin ise financial advice na samjha jaye. Kisi bhi trades se pehle barah e karam apni research khud karein۔","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-cta-button":"Abhi claim karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-disclaimer":"Sirf naye Binance sarifeen ke liye dastayab hai. Mazeed maloomat ke liye, hamari {{terms}} se ruju karein.","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-step1":"Binance par register karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-title":"Aaj apna muft {{income}} {{asset}} claim karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-step3":"Apna inaam claim karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-step2":"{{duration}} ke andar shanakht ki toseeq mukammal karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-default-steps-caption":"3 saada steps mein apna inaam claim karein","binance-academy-take-quiz":"Quiz mein hissa lein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-expired-cta-button":"Binance App download karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-expired-content":"Aaj hi Binance App par mazeed promotions daryaft karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-expired-title":"Aap ka inaam expire ho gya hai","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-review-cta-button":"Binance App download karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-suspended-title":"Aap is inaam ke liye eligible nahi hain","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-refused-cta-button":"Shanakht dubara jamaa karwayein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-refused-countdown":"Shanakht ki toseeq nakam ho gayi. Apna inaam claim karne ke liye {{countdown}} ke andar dubara jamaa karwayein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-refused-step2":"Shanakht ki toseeq nakam ho gayi. Barah e karam dubara jamaa karwayein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-refused-title":"Aap abhi bhi yeh kar sakte hein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-required-content":"Binance par register karne par aap ka shukriya","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-required-countdown":"Apna inaam claim karne ke liye {{countdown}} ke andar shanakht ki toseeq mukammal karein","learn-and-earn-course-staking-rewarded":"{{rewards}} Simple Earn Locked Inamat diye ja chuke hain","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-required-cta-button":"Abhi toseeq karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-required-step2":"Shanakht ki toseeq mukammal karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-required-title":"Aap ka inaam aap ka muntazir hai","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-review-content":"Aap ki shanakht ki toseeq mukammal hone ke baad aap ko inaam mosool ho ga","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-review-step2":"Shankht ki toseeq zer e jaeza hai","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-review-title":"Aap ka muft {{income}} {{asset}} taqreeban tayar hai","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-review-cta-button":"Toseeq ka status check karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-registered-disclaimer":"Mazeed maloomat ke liye, barah e karam {{terms}} se ruju karein.","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-passed-content":"Mubarak ho! Aap ka inaam aap ke account mein credit kar diya gya hai. Token voucher ka inaam redeem karne ke liye, apne account mei log in karein aur Reward Center mei jaein.","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-passed-cta-button":"Apna inaam claim karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-suspended-cta-button":"Binance App download karein","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-review-title":"Aap ka inaam taqreeban tayar hai","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-review-content":"Aap jald hi apna inaam claim kar sakte hain. Intezar ke doran Binance App download karein aur mazeed promotions daryaft karein.","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-passed-title":"Aap ka muft {{income}} {{asset}} tayar hai","learn-and-earn-active-popup-risk-suspended-content":"Aap ke account ke sath kuch masla hai. Mazeed maloomat ke liye Binance App download karein","learn-and-earn-course-not-rewarded":"{{rewards}} hasil karein","learn-and-earn-course-quiz-button-tip":"Pehle aap ko pura course mukammal karna ho ga.","learn-and-earn-course-quiz-button":"Quiz start karein","learn-and-earn-course-reward-all-redeemed":"Tamam inamat redeem ho gaye hain, intezar karein!","learn-and-earn-course-quiz-button-tip-before-kyc":"Quiz start karne ke liye tamam courses mukammal karein aur apne account ki toseeq karein.","learn-and-earn-course-staking-not-rewarded":"{{rewards}} Simple Earn Locked Inamat hasil karein","learn-and-earn-course-staking-reward-tip":"Principal aur rozana ki income mosool ki ja sakti hai","learn-and-earn-course-staking-reward-daily-suffix":"/ day","learn-and-earn-course-staking-reward-daily-amount":"Mujawaza Interest","learn-and-earn-course-staking-reward-duration":"Dorania","learn-and-earn-course-staking-reward-apy":"APR","learn-and-earn-course-staking-reward-principal":"Principal Inaam","learn-and-earn-course-rewarded":"{{rewards}} inaam de diye gaye hain","learn-and-earn-active-popup-kyc-refused-content":"Apna inaam claim karne ke liye shanakht ki toseeq mukammal karein","learn-and-earn-entry-desc":"Apne blockchain ke ilm mei izafa karein, quizzes mukammal karein, aur muft crypto hasil karein.","learn-and-earn-entry-cta-button":"Start karein","learn-and-earn-floating-button-expired":"Aap ka {{income}} {{asset}} expire ho gya hai","learn-and-earn-floating-button-risk-passed":"Aap ka muft {{income}} {{asset}} inaam tayar hai","learn-and-earn-floating-button":"Seekhein aur muft {{income}} {{asset}} hasil karein","learn-and-earn-floating-button-qualified":"Apna muft {{income}} {{asset}} inaam claim karein","learn-and-earn-floating-button-kyc-refused":"Aap ka {{income}} {{asset}} ap ka muntazir hai","learn-and-earn-floating-button-kyc-review":"Aap ka muft {{income}} {{asset}} taqreeban tayar hai","learn-and-earn-floating-button-risk-suspended":"Maazrat khuwa hain, aap is inaam ke liye eligible nahi hain","learn-and-earn-floating-button-risk-review":"Aap ka muft {{income}} {{asset}} taqreeban tayar hai","learn-and-earn-landing-course-cta-button":"Learning start karein","learn-and-earn-landing-desc":"Apne blockchain ke ilm mei izafa karein, quizzes mukammal karein, aur muft crypto hasil karein.","learn-and-earn-floating-button-kyc-required":"Aaj hi apna muft {{income}} {{asset}} claim karein","learn-and-earn-landing-history-button":"Inaam ki history","learn-and-earn-landing-risk-control-notification-text":"Mumkin hai ke aap is activity ke liye eligible na hon kiun ke aap ka account hmari khatre ki janch pass karne mei nakam raha hai.","learn-and-earn-landing-disclaimer":"Disclaimer: Barah e karam yeh check karne ke liye log in karein ke aya aap is activity ke liye eligible hein.","learn-and-earn-landing-kyc-notification-cta-button":"Abhi toseeq karein \u003e","learn-and-earn-landing-kyc-notification-text":"Apna inaam claim karne ke liye, aap ke liye pehle personal toseeq karna lazmi hai.","learn-and-earn-landing-risk-control-notification-cta-button":"Mazeed jaanein \u003e","learn-and-earn-landing-seo-desc":"Duniya ke leading crypto education platform ke sath fun aur mehfooz tareeke se ilm hasil karein.","learn-and-earn-landing-rules-button":"Activity ke qawaed","learn-and-earn-not-qualified-dialog-button":"Mai samajhta/samajhti hun","learn-and-earn-landing-seo-title":"Blockchain se mutaliq seekh kar crypto hasil karein","learn-and-earn-landing-title":"Seekhne ke zariye muft crypto hasil karein","learn-and-earn-entry-title":"Blockchain se mutaliq seekh kar crypto hasil karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-back-dialog-confirm":"Tasdeeq karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-back-title":"Course ki tafseelat","learn-and-earn-passive-popup-terms":"Sharayit o zwabit","learn-and-earn-passive-popup-content":"Binance par register karein aur inaam claim karne ke liye {{duration}} mei shnakht ki toseeq mukammal karein","learn-and-earn-passive-popup-disclaimer":"Sirf naye Binance sarifeen ke liye dastayab hai. Mazeed maloomat ke liye barah e karam {{terms}} ki taraf ruju karein.","learn-and-earn-passive-popup-heading":"{{income}} {{asset}}","learn-and-earn-passive-popup-title":"Aaj hi apna muft {{income}} {{asset}} claim karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed-cta-button":"Share karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-back-dialog-cancel":"Cancel karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-incomplete-cta-button":"Quiz mei dubara hissa lein","learn-and-earn-quiz-back-dialog-title":"Quiz khatam karein?","learn-and-earn-quiz-back-dialog-content":"Aap ke quiz ki progress zaya ho jaye gi.","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed":"Quiz mukammal ho gya","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed-staking-desc-1":"Mubarak ho! Aap ka inaam process kia ja raha hai, status ke liye aap inaam ki history check kar sakte hein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed-desc":"Participate karne par aap ka shukriya. Hum jaeza lein ge aur Inaami History ke page ke zariye nataij ka aelaan karein ge. Aap {{hours}} ghanton baad page ki taraf ruju kar sakte hain. Deegar sharayit/zwabit ke liye, barah e karam \u003chere-link\u003e\u003c/here-link\u003eyahan click karein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed-desc-1":"Mubarak ho! Aap ka inaam process kia ja raha hai, status ke liye aap inaam ki history check kar sakte hein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed-desc-2":"Ya aap {{hours}} ghanton ke andar Reward Center mei se apne inamat check kar sakte hein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-incomplete":"Quiz nakam ho gya","learn-and-earn-quiz-completed-staking-desc-2":"Ya aap {{hours}} ghanton ke andar Earn mei apne inaamat check kar sakte hein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-earn-center-link":"Earn Center","learn-and-earn-not-qualified-dialog-content":"Aap Binance par pehle hi register kar chuke hain. Yeh promotion sirf naye sarifeen ke liye dastayab hai.","learn-and-earn-not-qualified-dialog-title":"Maazrat khuwa hain","learn-and-earn-passive-popup-button":"Abhi claim karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-incomplete-desc":"Is course ke liye inaamat unlock karne ke liye, aap ko tamam sawalat ke drust jawabat dena hon ge. Barah e karam dubara koshish karein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-share-staking-subtitle":"Mein ne yeh course mukammal kar ke {{apy}} APR ke sath {{reward}} Simple Earn Locked Inamat hasil kiye! Abhi apne inamat hasil karein!","partner-contact-us-button":"Hum se raabta karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-question":"Sawal","learn-and-earn-quiz-result-all-redeemed-title":"Tamam inamat redeem kiye ja chuke hain","learn-and-earn-quiz-result-all-redeemed-desc":"Dastayab inaamat ke liye deegar courses check karein.","learn-and-earn-quiz-submit":"Jamaa karwayein","learn-and-earn-quiz-share-subtitle":"Mai ne yeh course mukammal kar ke {{amount}} hasil kiye. Ayein mil kar paisay kamate hein!","learn-and-earn-quiz-share-title":"Binance Learn \u0026 Earn","learn-and-earn-quiz-reward-center-link":"Reward Center","learn-and-earn-quiz-next-question":"Agla sawal","learn-and-earn-quiz-share-subtitle2":"Mai ne yeh course mukammal kar ke {{amount}} aur {{total}} deegar inamat hasil kiye. Ayein mil kar paisay kamate hein!","learn-and-earn-reward-history-method-cash-voucher":"Cash Voucher","learn-and-earn-restricted-region-desc":"Yeh course aap ke region mei dastayab nahi hai, barah e karam deegar courses explore karein.","learn-and-earn-reward-history-th1":"Course ka naam","learn-and-earn-reward-history-processing-tips":"Campaign ke nataij filhal zer e jaeza hain. Yeh {{hours}} ghanton baad dastayab hon ge. Deegar sharayit/zwabit ke liye, barah e karam \u003chere-link\u003eyahan\u003c/here-link\u003e click karein.","learn-and-earn-reward-history-tips":"Risk control ki wajuhaat ke bais inamat taqseem nahi kiye ja sakte.","learn-and-earn-reward-history-processing":"Processing","learn-and-earn-reward-history-nodata":"Koi data nahi","learn-and-earn-reward-history-method-locked-staking":"Simple Earn Locked Inamat","learn-and-earn-quiz-view-courses-link":"Deegar courses mulahiza karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-single":"(Behtreen jawab ka intekhab karein)","learn-and-earn-quiz-viewResult":"Nataij mulahiza karein","learn-and-earn-restricted-region-cta":"Courses mulahiza karein","learn-and-earn-reward-history-button":"Learning start karein","learn-and-earn-reward-history-th3":"Inaam ki kism","learn-and-earn-reward-history-th4":"Inaam diye jane ki tareekh","learn-and-earn-reward-history-title":"Inaam ki history","learn-and-earn-reward-history-method-crypto":"Crypto","learn-and-earn-reward-history-notEligible":"Eligible nahi hain","learn-and-earn-reward-history-th2":"Inaam","learn_and_earn_not_eligible_to_claim_rewards":"Maazrat ke sath, aap is promotion ke liye eligible nahi hain. Mazeed tafseelat ke liye promotion ke qawaed mulahiza karein.","learn_and_earn_not_eligible_to_claim_rewards_homepage":"Aap is promotion ke liye eligible nahi hain, barah e karam qawaed check karein","navigation-login":"Log In karein","navigation-register":"Register karein","navigation-verified":"Toseeq shuda","navigation-dashboard":"Dashboard","partner-become-partner":"Partner banein","navigation-unverified":"Gher toseeq shuda","learn-and-earn-title":"Learn \u0026 Earn","learn-and-earn-sub-account-limitation":"Sub-accounts participate karne ya kisi kism ke inamat ke liye eligible nahi hon ge.","navigation-logout":"Log Out karein","learn-and-earn-quiz-muti":"(Tamam qabil e itlaq ka antekhab karein)","partner-hear-from-partner":"Hamare partners aur students ki aara mulahiza karein","partner-educate-joint-effort-title":"Web3 mei students ko educate karne, engage karne aur ba ikhtiar bnane ki aik mushtarika koshish","partner-contact-us-title":"Mazeed maloomat darkar hain?","partner-headline-title":"Aaj hi Web3 education ke zariye crypto ke mustaqbil ko aage barhaein.","partner-contact-us-desc":"Har hafte apni email par crypto ki taza tareen updates hasil karein.","partner-landing-info-desc3-2":"Ilm mei izafa karne ke liye crypto ke wasayil ki tafseeli library","partner-hear-from-partner-author2- introduce":"CEO, Treccani Futura","partner-hear-from-partner-author1-introduce":"Masters ka Student, HEC Paris","partner-hero-title":"Duniya ko Web3 ke bare mein taleem fraham karne ke liye hamare sath partnership karein.","partner-landing-info-desc1-2":"Aap ke students ke liye Hackathons aur mentorships","partner-landing-info-desc2-1":"Campus mein mojoud apne peers tak Web3 ki taleem pohnchane mei madad karein","partner-landing-info-desc1-3":"Apne school ko hamare Student Ambassador program mein enroll karwaein","partner-landing-info-desc2-3":"Exclusive event ki invitations aur networking ke mawaqe","partner-landing-info-desc2-2":"Training aur certifications ke sath apna Web3 career shuru karein","partner-landing-info-desc2-4":"Web3 businesses aur partnerships ka exposure hasil karein","partner-landing-info-desc3-3":"Jadeed nisab aur blockchain career ki certifications","partner-landing-info-desc4-2":"Blockchain technology ke sath pasmanda communities ki muawnat karein","partner-landing-info-desc4-4":"Mutadid zubano mein dastiyab hai","partner-landing-info-desc1-1":"Career certificates ke sath Blockchain, crypto aur Web3 ke courses","partner-landing-info-desc3-1":"Hum beginners ke liye basic type ka content offer karte hain","partner-hero-desc-2":"Apne school mein crypto ki adoption aur taleem mein izafa karne ke liye Binance Student Ambassador program mein shamil hon!","partner-hear-from-partner-desc1":"Aik student ke tor par Binance Academy ka Global Education Initiative mere liye bohat faida mand hai. Mai ne un ke webinars/workshops se bohat kuch seekha hai. Woh waqai students ke liye crypto ke seekhne ke mahol ko farogh dete hain.... Humein un ka mission pasand hai ke sab ke liye crypto education ko aasaan dastiyab banaya jaye, aur hum mustaqbil mein un ke sath blockchain courses aur programs par collaboration ke liye purjosh hain.","partner-landing-info-desc3-4":"Hmari team ke sath mil kar nisab aur courses mushtarka tor par develop karein","partner-landing-info-desc4-1":"Apni workforce ko Web3 ke zaroori skills ke sath train karein","partner-hear-from-partner-desc2":"Nojawan afrad ke liye fintech ke mahol mein haal aur mustaqbil ke manzar namo ko samajhna zaroori hai. Binance Academy ke sath mil kar, hum apni universities mein Web3 aur blockchain ke hawalay se zyada aagahi fraham karne par twajja de rahe hain. Italy ki tawajja “Mustaqbil ki Maliyaat (Finance of the Future)” par markooz hai aur yeh Binance ke aalmi taleemi iqdam ke hissay ke tor par humein is azm ko haqeeqat banane ka mauqa fraham karta hai.","partner-hero-description":"Binance Academy aapki tanzeem ko maharat mein izafa karne aur wusa't dene ke liye tools aur wasayil fraham karti hai. Partner banein aur in tamam tools aur dusray wasayil tak rasayi hasil karein.","partner-hero-button":"Abhi darkhuwast dein","partner-hero-desc-1":"Binance Academy blockchain technology ke baray mein muft aur maqami taqazon ke mutabiq taleem fraham karti hai. Hamara mission duniya ko blockchain aur Web3 ki salahiyat ke bare mein taleem fraham karna hai.","partner-hear-from-partner-author2-introduce":"CEO, Treccani Futura","partner-hero- description":"Binance Academy aapki tanzeem ko maharat mein izafa karne aur wusa't dene ke liye tools aur wasayil fraham karti hai. Partner banein aur in tamam tools aur dusray wasayil tak rasayi hasil karein.","partner-landing-info-desc1-4":"Muft workshops aur webinars","partner-landing-info-desc4-3":"Crypto aur blockchain ki taleem se mutaliq policy ki tashkeel ke liye expert advice","partner-partnership":"Partnership","partner-student-angel":"Student Ambassador banein","partner-student-angel-benefits":"Student Ambassador ke fawayid","partner-student-angel-benefits-icon-text1":"Events ke liye exclusive invites","partner-student-angel-benefits-icon-text2":"Networking aur mentorship","partner-student-angel-benefits-icon-text3":"Khasoosi SWAG aur merchandise","partner-student-angel-benefits-icon-text4":"Internship aur nokri ke mawaqe","partner-student-angel-benefits-icon-text5":"Web3 Training aur Certificates","partner-student-angel-why-apply-card2-desc":"Yeh program kisi bhi resume ke liye behtareen izafa hai. Apni skills ko behtar bnaein aur Web3 pioneer ke tor par apni sakh banaein. Training aur certifications, virtual events ke liye support, aur experts aur mentors tak munfarid rasayi ke sath apne career ki shuruwat karein.","partner-landing-info-subtitle2":"Binance Student Ambassador Program mein shamil hon","partner-landing-info-title1":"Universities aur colleges","partner-landing-info-subtitle4":"Blockchain ki taleem ko phelane ke liye mil kar kaam karein","partner-landing-info-subtitle1":"Apni faculty aur greater community ko ba'ikhtiyar bnayein","partner-student-angel-why-apply-card1-title":"Farq paida karein","partner-landing-info-subtitle3":"Yaqeeni bnayein ke aap ke students Web3 ke liye tayar hon","partner-student-angel-why-apply-card1-desc":"Apne campus par crypto se mutaliq har cheez ke champion banein. Un students se connect karein jo blockchain aur Web3 ke hwale se aap jesa jazba rakhte hain aur apne tamam peers tak is technology ki taleem phelane mein madad karein.","partner-landing-info-title2":"Online taleem ke platforms","partner-student-angel-why-apply":"Aap ko kyun apply karna cahahiye?","partner-landing-info-title3":"Government aur NGOs","partner-hear-from-partner-author1- introduce":"Masters ka Student, HEC Paris","partner-student-angel-why-apply-card3-desc":"Apni local tech community mein leader banein aur campus par apne peers ko ba ikhtiyar bnaein. Web3 events ki mezbani karein, dusre students ko guidance dein aur Web3 ke businesses aur mumkina sponsorships ka exposure hasil karein.","partner-student-angel-why-apply-card3-title":"Leadership ka tajaraba","partner-student-angel-why-apply-card2-title":"Mustaqbil mein Career ke Mawaqay","share-poster-download":"Download karein","share-poster-share":"Share karein","share-poster-dialogTitle":"Share karein","partner-we-work-title":"Hum kin ke sath kaam karte hain","partner-institutions":"Institutions","partner-student-ambassador":"Student Ambassador","binance-academy-study-week":"Product Guides","binance_academy_recently_published":"Haaliya tor par publish karda","binance_academy_recently_updated":"Haaliya tor par update karda","binance_academy_most_viewed":"Sab se zyada dekha gya","binance-academy-error-sub-account":"Ho sakta hai aap is activity ke liye aehel na hon kiun ke aapka account sub-account hai.","binance-academy-error-region-not-available":"Yeh course aap ke region mein dastiyab nahi hai, barah e karam deegar courses daryaft karein.","binance-academy-error-risk-assessment":"Ho sakta hai aap is activity ke liye eligible na hon kyun ke aapka account risk assessment mein fail ho gya hai.","binance-academy-error-high-traffic":"Humein is waqt gher mamuli tor par zyada traffic ka samna hai. Barah e karam thori der baad dubara koshish karein.","binance-academy-error-rewards-all-redeemded":"Tamam inamat redeem kiye ja chuke hain.","binance-academy-error-claim-without-identity-verification":"Apna inaam claim karne ke liye pehle shanakht ki tasdeeq ka amal mukammal karein.","binance-academy-error-already-redeemed":"Aap pehle hi inaam ko redeem kar chuke hain. Barah e karam apni inaami history mein inaam ka status check karein.","binance-academy-courses":"Courses","binance-academy-course-rewarded":"Inaam de dya gya","binance-academy-course-quiz-next-course":"Agla course","binance-academy-ok":"Ok","binance-academy-congratulations":"Aap apni studies mukammal karne aur apna certificate mosool karne se sirf {{x}} modules door hain! Achaa kaam jari rakhein!","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-inactive-tooltip":"Tamaam {{num}} courses mukammal karne par certificate mosool karein","binance-academy-course-first-course-congrats":"Ye course mukammal karne par Mubarakbaad! Baqi courses jald aa rahe hain. Bakhabar rahein!","binance-academy-course-further-reading":"Mazeed Reading","binance-academy-course-coming-soon":"Jald aa raha hai","binance-academy-course-view-my-nft":"Mera NFT mulahiza karein","binance-academy-course-share-with-friends":"Doston ke sath share karein","binance-academy-course-share-nft-desc":"Mubarak ho! Aap ne kamyabi se NFT claim kar liya hai. Aap \u003cnft-link\u003e\u003c/nft-link\u003eBinanace NFT mein apna NFT mulahiza kar sakte hain.","binance-academy-course-module-index":"Module:","binance-academy-go-to-course":"Courses par jayein","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-modal-desc":"Aap ka certificate muntazir hai!","binance-academy-course-num-of-course":"{{num}} Courses","binance-academy-course-learn-now":"Abhi seekhein","binance-academy-course-minutes":"{{minutes}} Minutes","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-button":"Course start karein","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-modal-button":"Inaam claim karein","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-modal-title":"Course mukammal karne par mubarakbaad! Abhi apna certificate unlock karein.","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-desc":"Hamare fun aur interactive courses ke zariye free mein apne ilm mei izafa karein. Binance Academy beginners, intermediate aur advanced learners ke liye sab se jamiya taleemi courses ki lineup pesh karta hai۔","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-nft-diploma-desc":"Seekhne ke saboot ke tor par apni Kamyabi ka Certificate claim karaein.","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-title":"Crypto ke bare mein seekhein aur inaamat hasil karein","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-nft-diploma-title":"Certificate mosool karein","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-duration-desc":"Lakhon logon ke sath shamil hon aur Binance Academy ke standard set karne wale educational programs se seekhna shuru karein","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-win-crypto-title":"1 BTC jeetein","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-learn-free-title":"Muft mein seekhein","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-learn-free-desc":"Quizzes mukammal karein aur inamat hasil karein.","binance-academy-course-faq":"FAQ","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-win-crypto-desc":"Dosto ko course ke liye sign up karne ki gharz se invite karein aur 1 BTC jeetne ka moqa payein.","binance-academy-course-homepage-cta-duration-title":"One-Stop Learning Hub","binance-academy-course-homepage-hero-2":"Seekhein. Earn karein.","binance-academy-course-homepage-hero-1":"Crypto ki muft taleem","binance-academy-course-login-register-modal-title":"Certificate claim karne ke liye seekhna jari rakhein","binance-academy-course-homepage-hero-3":"Smart investor banein.","binance-academy-course-quiz-next-module":"Agla module","binance-academy-course-quiz-submit":"Jamaa karwayein","binance-academy-course-login-register-modal-button":"Log in / register karein","binance-academy-course-quiz-try-again":"Dubara koshish karein","binance-academy-course-quiz":"Quiz","binance-academy-course-start-learning":"Course start karein","binance-academy-course-claim-reward":"Inaam claim karein","binance-academy-course-unlock-module-tip":"Yeh module unlock karne aur inamat haasil karne ke liye, is se pehle module 1 mukammal karein aur apne Binance account mei sign in karein","binance-academy-course-login-register-modal-desc":"Course mukammal karne ke liye apne Binance account mei log in karein ya register karein.","binance-academy-course-nth-course":"Course {{nth}}:","binance-academy-course-other-courses":"Mazeed courses","binance-academy-verify-now":"Abhi tasdeeq karein","binance-academy-course-nth-module":"Module:","binance-academy-cancel":"Cancel karein","binance-academy-course-login-alert":"Progress ko track karne ke liye apne Binance account mein log in karein aur apne certificate ka dawah karein. Log in kiye bagher aap apni learning progress se mehroom ho sakte hain.","binance-academy-course-diploma-share-poster-title":"Binance Academy ke courses","binance-academy-course-diploma-share-poster-desc":"Mujhe ye course mukammal karne par abhi apna certificate mosool hua hai. Chlein mil kar study karte hain!","binance-academy-course-quiz-next":"Aagy jayein","binance-academy-course":"Course","binance-academy-error-system-busy":"System busy hai. Barah e karam baad mein dobara koshish karein.","learn_and_earn_not_eligible_to_claim_rewards_staking":"Ye quiz aur inaam sirf un users ke liye dastiyab hai jin ka is se qabal koi Stacking record nahi tha.","binance-academy-course-landing-og-desc":"Binance Academy ke mayaar qaim karne wale, amli taleemi programs se seekhne ke liye lakhon afraad ke sath shamil hon. Courses khatam hone aur quizzes mukammal hone ke baad apna certificate hasil karein.","binance-academy-course-landing-og-title":"Blockchain Knowledge ke liye Crypto Courses mein dakhla lein | Binance Academy","learn-and-earn-tag-text-ended":"Mukammal shuda","learn-and-earn-tag-text-ongoing":"Jari","binance-academy-learn-and-earn-ongoing":"Jari sargarmiyan","binance-academy-learn-and-earn-ended":"Mukammal shuda sargarmiyan","binance-academy-learn-and-earn-all":"Tamaam","learn-and-earn-view-other-course":"Deegar courses mulahiza karein","learn-and-earn-taken-course-before":"Aap ne phle he ye course le liya hai, bra e karam deegar courses explore karein.","learn-and-earn-login-and-not-available-country":"Ye quiz aur inaam aap ke mulk mein dastiyab nahi hai.","learn-and-earn-login-and-need-kyc-after":"Ye quiz aur inaam sirf naye KYC sarifeen ke liye dastiyaab hai.","learn-and-earn-login-and-staking-reward-not-compliance":"Aap is Promotion ke liye ahl nahi hain.","learn-and-earn-no-login-no-permission":"Brah e karam apni ahliyat check karne ke liye log in karein.","learn-and-earn-login-and-need-register-before":"Ye quiz aur inaam sirf mojooda sarifeen ke liye dastiyab hai.","learn-and-earn-login-and-need-register-after":"Ye quiz aur inaam sirf naye sarifeen ke liye dastiyaab hai.","learn-and-earn-login-and-need-kyc-before":"Ye quiz aur inaam sirf mojooda KYC sarifeen ke liye dastiyab hai.","partner-we-work-ole":"Online Learning Platforms","partner-we-work-ngo":"NGOs","partner-we-work-vcs":"Vocational Schools","partner-we-work-k12":"K12","partner-we-work-university":"Universities","partner-we-work-government":"Governments","binance-academy-learn-and-earn-disclaimer-part-2":"Digital asset ki qeemtein ghair mustahkum ho sakti hain. Aap ki sarmayakari ki value kam ya ziada ho sakti hai aur ho sakta hai ke aap ko apni lagai gai raqam wapis na milay. Aap ke saramayakari ke faislon ki mukammal zamadari aap par hai aur Binance Academy aap ko honay walay kisi bhi qisam ke nuqsanaat ke liye zimadar nahi hai. Is mawad ko mali, qanooni ya deegar qisam ki professional advice nahi samjha jana chahiye. Mazeed maloomat ke liye, hamari \u003cterm-link\u003eIstemal ki Sharaait\u003c/term-link\u003e aur \u003crisk-link\u003eKhatray ka Intibah\u003c/risk-link\u003e mulahiza karein.","binance-academy-learn-and-earn-disclaimer-part-1":"Ye content aap ke liye \"jesa hai\" ki bunyaad par sirf amoomi maloomat aur taleemi maqaasid ki gharz se pesh kiya giya hai, aur is mein kisi qisam ki numaindagi ya zamanat shamil nahin. Isse mali, qanooni ya deegar qisam ki professional advice nahi samjha jana chahiye, na he is ka maqsad kisi makhsoos product ya service ki khareedari ki tajweez dena hai. Aap ko chahiye keh zati mashwaray ke liye muta'alqa professional advisors se mashwara lein. Is article mein biyan karda products aap ke ilaaqay mein dastiyab nahi hain. Jahan ye article kisi third party contributor ki janib se pesh kia jaye, barahe karam note karein  wo khayalat us third party contributor ke hain, aur zaroori nahin ke wo Binance Academy ke mu'aqif ki akasi krte hon. Mazeed tafseelat ke liye barahe karam hamara \u003chere-link\u003epoora disclaimer\u003c/here-link\u003e parhein.","binance-academy-course-nft-sanction-region-notification":"NFT certificate filahl aap ke mulk ya region mein dastiyab nahi hai.","binance-academy-course-go-to-homepage":"Homepage par jayen","binance-academy-course-verification-modal-title":"Course mukammal karne par mubarakbaad! Abhi apna certificate unlock karein.","binance-academy-course-verification-modal-desc":"Binance Identity Verification mukammal karne par certificate claim kya ja sakta hai.","academy-course-modal-description":"Aj he apnay blockchain ke ilm mein izafa karein!","academy-course-modal-title":"Academy Courses","academy-course-modal-title-prefix":"Dakhla lein","binance-academy-article-outline":"Article Outline","binance-academy-related-articles":"Mutaliqa Articles","binance-academy-related-glossaries":"Mutaliqa Glossaries","binance-academy-share-posts":"Posts share karein","course-profile-accomplishments":"{{name}} ki Kamyabiyan","course-profile-view-card-description":"{{time}} ko {{name}} ki janib se mukammal kiya giya","course-blank-tips":"Aap ko apnay mukammal karda courses yahan milein gay.","course-profile-view-nft-certificate":"NFT ka inaam mulahiza karein","course-button-start-learning":"Learning start karein","course-share-popup-title":"Binance Academy Courses","course-tabs-in-progress":"Jari hai","course-banner-text":"Crypto seekhein aur inaamat hasil karein","course-button-continue-learning":"Seekhna jari rakhein","course-tabs-completed":"Mukammal karda","course-share-popup-description":"Mujhe ye course mukammal karne par abhi apna certificate mosool hua hai. Chlein mil kar parhte hain!","course-tabs-all-courses":"Tamaam courses","course-profile-course-completed":"Courses mukammal ho gaye","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-modal-title-2":"Course mukammal karne par bohot khoob! Ab aap apna certificate unlock kar sakte hain.","binance-academy-course-view-certificate":"Certificate mulahiza karein","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-modal-desc-2":"Barah e karam apna naam humein fraham karein taake hum aapka certificate takhleeq kar sakein. Barah e karam note karein ke ek martaba submit hone ke baad is mein tarmeem nahi ki ja sakti.","binance-academy-course-certificate-share-poster-desc":"Mujhe ye couse mukammal karne par abhi apna certificate mosool hua hai. Chlein mil kar study karte hain!","binance-academy-course-claim-reward-modal-your-name":"Aap ka naam","binance-academy-course-certificate":"Certificate","binance-academy-course-certificate-share-poster-title":"Mubarak ho! Aap ne kamyabi se NFT claim kar liya hai. Aap \u003clink\u003e\u003c/link\u003eyahan apna certificate mulahiza kar sakte hain.","binance-academy-japan-disclaimer":"Aap ko jis site par bhja ja rha hai, us ko Binance Japan ki janib se operate nahi kiya jata aur Binance Japan is site se mutalliqa kisi bhi qism ki maloomat ya services waghera ke liye zimadar nahi hai. Destination-site ki sharaait o zawaabit aap par laagu hoti hain. Is site ko sirf maloomati maqaasid ke liye takhleeq kiya gya hai aur is ka maqsad sarmayakaari ki darkhast karna nahi hi.","binance-academy-confirm":"Tasdeeq karein","binance-academy-pdf-cert-desc3":"Takmeel par, learners ko university se tasleem shuda PDF certificate mosool ho ga, jis par partnering institution ka naam darj ho ga.","binance-academy-pdf-cert-desc2":"Aap apnay personal avatar - [Completed] mein [My course] par ja kar apne PDF certificates mulahiza kar sakte hain.","binance-academy-nft-cert-desc3":"Note: NFT certificates kuch regions mein gher dastiyab hain aur ye transfer ya trade nahi kiye ja sakte.","binance-academy-pdf-cert-title":"Is course ki takmeel par PDF certificate hasil karein.","binance-academy-pdf-and-nft-cert-title":"Is course ki takmeel par ziada se ziada 6 NFT aur PDF certificates hasil karein.","binance-academy-pdf-and-nft-cert-desc1":"Har couse ki takmeel par, learners ko NFT aur PDF certificate mosool ho ga. Is ka matlab hai ke Intermediate Tack mein ziada se ziada  6 certificates dastiyab hain.","binance-academy-pdf-cert-desc1":"Takmeel par, learners ko PDF certificate mosool ho ga.","binance-academy-nft-cert-desc2":"Aap ka NFT certificate tamaam matlooba course assignments mukammal karne ke baad 14 din ke andar aap ke Binance account mein dikhai de ga. Aap [Binance NFT] - [Profile] - [Collected NFTs] par ja kar apne NFT certificates check kar sakte hain.","binance-academy-congratulations-desc-new":"Aap apni studies mukammal karne aur certificate mosool karne se sirf {{x}} modules door hain! Achaa kaam jari rakhein!","binance-academy-nft-cert-title":"Is course ki takmeel par NFT certificate hasil karein.","binance-academy-paied-course-not-login-btn":"Log In karein","binance-academy-paied-course-not-login-text":"\"Oops! Aisa lagta hai ke aap is course ka content mulahiza karne ke liye log in nahi hain. Aap ko jald he wapis landing page par bhej diya jaye ga. Samajhnay ke liye shukriya.\"","binance-academy-continue-course-new":"Course jari rakhein","binance-academy-nft-cert-desc1":"Takmeel par, learners ko NFT certificate mosool ho ga.","binance-academy-course-payment-button":"${{dollar}} ke lye abhi dakhla lein","binance-academy-congratulations-new":"Mubaarak ho!","binance-academy-course-skill-level-beginner":"Beginner","binance-academy-course-learned":"Seekh liya","binance-academy-course-skill-level-advanced":"Advanced","binance-academy-course-skill-level-intermediate":"Intermediate","binance-academy-completed":"Mukammal ho gya","binance-academy-completed-desc":"{{username}} ki janib se {{date}} ko mukammal kya gya","binance-academy-course-learn":"Seekhein","binance-academy-i-completed-desc":"Aap ne tamaam courses mukammal kar liye hain aur apna certificate mosool kar liya hai.","binance-academy-in-process":"Jari hai","binance-academy-you-completed-desc":"Ab aap ne is course mein mojood tamaam modules mukammal kar liye hain aur aap ko certificate mil giya hai. Isse apne doston ke sath share karein! \u003chyperlink\u003e\u003c/hyperlink\u003ecertificate mulahiza karein:","binance-academy-study-together":"{{username}}  ne abhi ye course mukammal kar ke certificate mosool kiya hai. Chalein mil kar study karte hain!","binance-academy-congratulations-desc":"Course jari rakhein","binance-academy-continue-course":"{{username}} ne abhi ye course mukammal kar ke certificate mosool kiya hai. Chalein mil kar study karte hain!","binance-academy-specialization-course":"Specialization Course","binance-academy-next-module":"Agla module","binance-academy-quiz-finished-text":"Mubaarak ho aap ne kamyabi se ye course pass kar liya hai!","binance-academy-check-desc":"Dekhein, main Binance Academy mein {{x}} courses tak ponch gya/gai hun!","binance-academy-all-category":"Tamaam Categories","binance-academy-continue-learning":"Learning jari rakhein","binance-academy-university-course":"University Course","binance-academy-try-again":"Dobara koshish karein","binance-academy-mins":"{{x}} Minutes","binance-academy-my-course":"Meray courses","binance-academy-course-obtain-syllabus":"Syllabus","binance-academy-network-error":"Waja: Network ki kharabi","binance-academy-course-payment-failed":"Payment nakaam ho gai","binance-academy-course-video":"Videos","binance-academy-course-start-to-learn":"Learning start karein","binance-academy-course-payment-successful":"Aap ne kamyabi se ye* course khareed liya hai.","binance-academy-quiz":"Quiz","binance-academy-course-obtain-cert-desc":"Koi bhi course mukammal karne par, learners ko professional certificate mosool ho ga, jis mein course ki description, signature, aur partnering institution ka naam shamil hai. Ye certificate learner dashboard par mulahiza kiya ja sakata hai aur wahan se download kiya ja sakta hai.","binance-academy-course-instructor":"Instructor","binance-academy-course-obtain-cert-title":"Professional certificate hasil karein","binance-academy-course-offerd-by":"Design karda minjanib","binance-academy-course-finished-cert-desc":"Takmeel par tasleem shuda certificate ki frahmi","binance-academy-course-overview":"Majmooi jaaiza","binance-academy-course-completed-time":"Mukammal karne ka waqt","binance-academy-course-level":"Skill Level","binance-academy-course-more-about-course":"Is course se mutalliq mazeed","binance-academy-overview-cert-nft-title":"NFT certificate hasil karein","binance-academy-overview-cert-pdf-and-nft-desc":"Is track ki takmeel par, learners ko NFT aur PDF certificate mosool ho ga.","binance-academy-overview-cert-pdf-title":"PDF certificate hasil karein","binance-academy-overview-cert-nft-desc":"Is track ki takmeel par, learners ko NFT certificate mosool ho ga.","binance-academy-overview-cert-pdf-and-nft-title":"NFT aur PDF certificates hasil karein","binance-academy-overview-cert-pdf-desc":"Takmeel par, learners ko PDF certificate mosool ho ga, jis par partnering institution ka naam darj ho ga.","binance-academy-copy-success":"Kamyabi se copy karein","binance-academy-cookie-preference":"Cookie ki tarjeehat","binance-academy-linkin-add-to-profile":"Profile mein shamil karein","binance-academy-start-to-learn":"Course start karein","binance-academy-course-all-banner-title":"Web3 aur Blockchain Courses","binance-academy-course-university-logo-title1":"Hamaray","binance-academy-course-all-banner-desc":"Binance Academy ke muntakhib karda khud se seekhne walay crypto courses ke zariye apne cryopto ke ilam ko waseeh karein.","binance-academy-course-university-logo-title2":"Partners","binance-academy-course-paid-course":"Paid Course","binance-academy-course-category-all-course":"Tamaam courses","binance-academy-chosse-course-question":"Binance Academy ke Courses hi kyun?","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-1-desc":"Salon ke tajurbay ke hamil industry ke mahireen se seekhein.","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-3-title":"Interactive Learning","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-2-title":"Tafseeli Nisaab","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-1-title":"Mahireen ki rehnumai mein tayar shuda content","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-3-desc":"Apni learning ko mazboot banane ke lye interactive tutorials, quizzes aur haqeeqi duniya ki misalon (real-world applications) ke sath jurein.","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-4-desc":"Hamaray PDF aur NFT certificates ke sath apne learning ke safar mein value aur aitbaar shamil karein.","binance-academy-square-top-creator":"Binance Square Top Creator","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-4-title":"Achievement ke Certificates","binance-academy-chosse-course-answer-2-desc":"Beginner se advanced trading strategies ke hamil topics ki waseeh range tak rasaai hasil karein, jo tamam levels aur goals ke mutabiq tiyar kiye gaye hain.","binance-academy-students-content2":"Is se beginners ko Web3, Blockchain Technology ke bunyadai qawaaid, aur mazeed seehkne mein madad milay gi.\nAik Academy certificate hasil karne ke baad, EBU se dusra certificate mosool karna waqai qabl e qadar hai.","binance-academy-students-content1":"Mujhe ye andaaz bohat pasand aya ke course mein blockchain technology ko tafseel se samjhaya gya. Instructors, Dr. Jakub Jedlinský aur Kareem Abdallah apni aala maharat aur munfarid nuqta nazar se issy mazeed muassar banaya.","binance-academy-students-content":"Student ki jaanch","binance-academy-students-content5":"Dr. Schmalbach blockchain technology ke qeemti tajurbay aur tafseeli ilm ke hamil hain.\nUn ke lectures sun kar khushi hui; wo pecheeda concepts ko wazeh aur qable faham andaaz mein sanjhanay ki salahiyat rakhte hain.","binance-academy-students-content3":"Ziada tar blockchain courses mushkil hote hain, lekin ye wala haqeeqat mein purlutf tha.\nIs ne P2P networks ko tafseel se cover kiya, aur quizzes game ki tarah lagy, jis se mujhe aagay barhne ki targheeb mili.","binance-academy-students-content4":"VŠE course ne haqeeqat mein mery ilam mein izafa kiya, aur main ne jo kuch seekha, mustaqbil mein issy dusron ke sath share karne ka/ki muntazir hun. Mujhe ye baat pasand aai ke course ke authors ne naye alfaz ki tashreeh ke liye aam feham misalein (analogies) istemal kien.","binance-academy-binance-angel":"Binance Angel","binance-academy-course-category-partner-course":"Partner Courses","binance-academy-course-category-academy-course":"Academy Courses","learn-and-earn-risk-control-notification-btn":"Appeal","learn-and-earn-kyc-notification-text":"Ye quiz is course ke ikhtatam par zahir nahi ho ga kyun ke inaam aap ke mulk/region mein mojood sarifeen ke liye dastiyab nahi hai.","learn-and-earn-subaccount-notification-text":"Ye quiz ikhtatam par zahir nahi ho ga kyun ke aap sub account ke sath log in kar rahy hain","learn-and-earn-risk-control-notification-text":"Afsos ke sath, kyun ke aap ne Binance ke istemal ki sharaait ki khilaf warzi ki hai, is liye aap inaamat mosool karne ke liye quiz mein shirkat nahi kar sakte.","academy-study-week":"Listed Projects","learn-and-earn-course-eligible-notification-text":"Is course ka inaam aap ke mulk/region ke liye dastiyab nahi hai.","binance-academy-homepage-title1":"BINANCE ACADEMY","binance-academy-homepage-title2":"BLOCKCHAIN AUR CRYPTO KI TALEEM","binance-academy-homepage-shortcuts-title":"Shortcuts","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-article":"Articles","binance-academy-homepage-learn-earn-tag":"Seekhein aur earn karein","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-course":"Courses","binance-academy-homepage-featured-tag":"Khusoosi","binance-academy-homepage-course-entry-btn":"Start karein","binance-academy-homepage-course-entry-desc":"Crypto mein bilkul naye hain? Bunyadi cheezein seekhne ke liye hamaray muft, short, beginner courses mein dakhla lein.","binance-academy-homepage-parter-title":"Binance Academy ke sath partner banna chahte hain?","binance-academy-homepage-articles-non-beginner":"Crypto Trading","binance-academy-homepage-event-tag":"Event","binance-academy-homepage-suggested-title":"Tajweez karda","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-learn-earn":"Seekhein aur earn karein","binance-academy-homepage-course-entry-title":"Crypto Beginner Courses","binance-academy-homepage-parter-btn":"Hamaray sath shamil hon","binance-academy-homepage-articles-latest":"Taza tareen content","binance-academy-homepage-articles-beginner":"Beginners ke liye Crypto","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-produce-guideline":"Product Guides","binance-academy-homepage-minutes":"{{x}} minutes","binance-academy-homepage-see-all":"Tamaam ko dekhein","binance-academy-homepage-title3":"Global Community mein shamil hon aur Crypto aur Blockchain se mutalliq muft seekhein!","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-crypto-security":"Crypto Security","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-meme-coins":"Meme Coins","binance-academy-search-page-tab-course":"Course","binance-academy-search-page-tab-glossary":"Glossaries","binance-academy-course-university-logo-title-v2":"Hamaray partners","binance-academy-new-learner-special-description":"Kia aap crypto ki duniya mein naye hain? Binance Academy Beginner Track mukammal karein aur inamat ki surat mein 9,000 USDC ka share hasil karein! Sargarmi ki Muddat: 2025-03-18 09:00 (UTC) se 2025-03-31 09:00 (UTC) takk hai","binance-academy-highlight-new-learner-special":"Naye student ke liye Khasoosi offer","binance-academy-highlight-intermediate-track":"Intermediate Track","binance-academy-highlight-intermediate-track-description":"Intermediate Track blockchain technology ki bareekiyon (intricacies) ko bakhoobi samajhne ki sahulat deta hai, aur yeh un logon ki muharton mein mazeed izafa karne ke liye design kiya gaya hai jo pehle se cryptocurrencies ke bunyadi usoolon ki samajh rakhte hain.","binance-academy-highlight-beginner-track-description":"Beginner Track blockchain ecosystem ka ek ibtidai jaiza faraham karta hai taa keh naye aaney walay logon ko bunyadi tasawuraat samajhne mein madad mile jo cryptocurrency ki duniya mein navigation ke liye zaruri hain.","binance-academy-highlight-beginner-track":"Beginner Track","binance-academy-see-all-articles":"Tamam articles dekhein","binance-academy-see-all-glossaries":"Tamam glossaries dekhein","binance-academy-dev-academy-subtitle":"Developer ke liye technical articles","binance-academy-dev-academy-title":"Developer Academy","binance-academy-dev-academy-introduction":"Ta'aruf","binance-academy-dev-academy-market-data":"Market ka Data","binance-academy-dev-academy-api-protocols":"API Protocols","binance-academy-dev-academy-seo-description":"Binance APIs, trading bots, aur blockchain integration ke baray mein tafseeli tutorials, guides, aur resources explore karein. Binance Developer Academy ke amli content ke zariye apni developer skills ko mazeed behtar banayein.","binance-academy-dev-academy-seo-title":"Binance Developer Academy: Developers ke liye Blockchain aur Crypto API se mutaliq Tutorials","binance-academy-courses-seo-title":"Crypto Courses | Muft mein Blockchain aur Web3 seekhein","binance-academy-partner-seo-title":"Binance Academy ke sath partnership karein | Blockchain taleem ko behtar banayein.","binance-academy-homepage-seo-title":"Binance Academy | Crypto aur Blockchain ki muft Taleem","binance-academy-ambassador-seo-title":"Binance Academy Student Ambassador | Apne Campus mein Web3 ki Sarbarahi karein","binance-academy-courses-seo-description":"Crypto, DeFi, NFTs aur blockchain ke muft online courses ke baray mein janein. Binance Academy par apni raftar se seekhna shuru karein.","binance-academy-ambassador-seo-description":"Binance Academy ke Student Ambassador banein. Crypto education ko promote karein, events host karein, aur apne campus mein apna Web3 network banayein.","binance-academy-homepage-seo-description":"Binance Academy ke muft expert tutorials, videos, aur courses ke zariye crypto, blockchain aur Web3 mein muharat hasil karein.","binance-academy-partner-seo-description":"Binance Academy ke sath mil kar blockchain aur Web3 ki taleem ko apne institution ya duniya bhar ki community tak pohanchayein.","binance-academy-bitcoin-title":"Bitcoin: Paise ka naya daur","binance-academy-bitcoin-earn-btc":"Apna pehla Bitcoin Learn \u0026 Earn complete karne par \u003cearn-text\u003eBTC hasil karein\u003c/earn-text\u003e!","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-btc":"\u003clearn-text\u003eSeekhein\u003c/learn-text\u003e aur duniya ke pehle kam qeemat digital asset ka hissa hasil karein.","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-content1":"Marhala 1: Binance Academy ke liye sign up karein. Yeh muft hai!","binance-academy-bitcoin-step2-content3":"Us ke baad, Satoshi Nakamoto naam ki ek gumnaam shakhsiyat ne Bitcoin mutaarif karwaya—paise ki ek nayi surat jo hamesha ke liye duniya ko badal dene wali thi.","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-content3":"Marhala 3: Aap ke quiz ke tamam sawalon ke sahi jawab dene ki surat mein 0.00001 BTC hasil karein.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-content1":"Miners taqatwar computers istemal karte hain taa keh mushkil mathematical masail hal kar sakein. Is tasdeeqi system ko Proof of Work (PoW) kehte hain.","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-content2":"Marhala 2: \"Bitcoin Basics\" Learn \u0026 Earn mukammal karein.","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-btn":"Quiz mein hissa lein","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-subtitle":"Mining ek aesa amal hai jis ke zariye nayi transactions ki tasdeeq ki jati hai aur unhein blockchain mein shamil kiya jata hai:","binance-academy-bitcoin-seo-description":"Bitcoin ki history, technology aur aaj ke daur mein is ki ehmiyat ko samjhein. Binance Academy ke sath seekhein aur apna pehla Bitcoin hasil karein. Sign up karein aur apna crypto ka safar abhi shuru karein!","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-content4":"Mining ke inamat taqreeban har 4 saal baad aadhe ho jate hain, jis se Bitcoin ban’ne ki raftar kam ho jati hai, yahan tak keh wo 21 million ki hadd ko pohanch jaye.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step3-title":"Bitcoin Kaise Kam karta hai?","binance-academy-bitcoin-step3-content1":"Bitcoin blockchain technology par chalta hai—ek public ledger jo computers ke distributed network ke zariye mehfooz kiya jata hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item6-desc":"Har Bitcoin ko 100 million chote units mein taqseem kiya ja sakta hai, jinhein satoshis kaha jata hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step1-content1":"Bitcoin pehli aur sab se zyada mashhoor cryptocurrency hai. Kuch log isay ek jadeed adaegi ke tareeqay ke tor par dekhte hain, jab keh doosre isay “digital gold” ke tor par qeemti samajhte hain.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step3-content2":"Blockchain ko aik kitab ki tarah samjhein, jahan har safha (block) transactions se bhara hota hai. Har block pichle block ke sath link hota hai, aur is tarah blocks ki aik musalsal chain ban jati hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-subtitle":"Aap ke Bitcoin ke safar ka jashan manane ke liye, hum aap ko apna pehla Bitcoin Learn \u0026 Earn mukammal karne par 0.00001 BTC kamane ka moqa de rahe hain.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item3-desc":"Blockchain ek taqseem-shuda public ledger hai. Yeh har kisi ke liye qabuil e rasai hota hai jise woh istemal bhi kar sakta hai aur audit bhi kar sakta hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step2-tips":"The Times 03/Jan/2009 Chancellor banks ko doosri financial madad dene ke qareeb tha.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item6-title":"Qabile taqseem hai","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item1-title":"Tadad mein kam hai","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-tips":"Sirf naye Binance saarifeen","binance-academy-bitcoin-step2-title":"Bitcoin kis ne Banaya?","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-content3":"Mining network ko mehfooz rakhta hai aur is baat ko yaqeeni banata hai keh sirf jaaiz transactions hi record hon.","binance-academy-bitcoin-learn-and-earn-title":"BTC ke bara mein Seekhein aur Kamayein!","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-summary":"Kuch saalon mein kai coins gum ho jane ki wajah se, mojooda Bitcoin ki kul tadad 21 million se kafi kam hai, jo is ki qillat (scarcity) ko mazeed barha deta hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-title":"Bitcoin Qeemti kiun hai?","binance-academy-bitcoin-watch-btc-btn":"BTC Video Dekhein","binance-academy-bitcoin-seo-title":"Bitcoin Kia hota hai? Seekhein, Kamayein, aur Apna pehla BTC hasil karein | Binance Academy","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item2-title":"Sarhad se baalatar hai","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item2-desc":"Aap kabhi bhi, kahin bhi BTC bhej aur receive kar sakte hain. Transactions tez hoti hain aur fees bohat kam hoti hain.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step2-content1":"2008 ke maali buhran ke dauran, logon ka banks aur governments par aetimad apni tareekh ki sab se nichli satah par tha.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item3-title":"Shafaf hai","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item1-desc":"Bitcoin ki supply mehdood hai, jis ki wajah se yeh mehngai se mutasir nahi hota. 21 million se zyada BTC kabhi bhi create nahi kiye ja sakte.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item5-desc":"Mazboot cryptography aur ek distributed network data ki security aur us ki na-qabil-e-tabdeel salahiyat ko yaqeeni banata hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item5-title":"Mehfooz hai","binance-academy-bitcoin-step3-content3":"Jab transaction data blockchain mein shamil kar diya jata hai, to usay tabdeel nahi kiya ja sakta, jis ki wajah se yeh mehfooz rehta hai aur us mein tampering karna mumkin nahi hota.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step1-content4":"Yeh internet ke daur ki currency hai: sarhadon se azad, mehfooz, aur wazeh.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-title":"Bitcoin Mining kia hai?","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-subtitle":"Aaj duniya pehle ki nisbat bohat tezi se chal rahi hai, lekin aam paisa ab bhi puranay usoolon par chalta hai. Jab keh Bitcoin ek mukhtalif cheez hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-change-period":"3 saalon mein","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item4-desc":"Na koi hukoomati idara aur na hi koi aik fard Bitcoin ko control kar sakta hai. Yeh logon ki milkiyat hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step2-content2":"Log us waqt ghabra gaye jab un ke assets ki qeemat kam hone lagi aur maaliyati idaaray (financial institutions) diwaliya hone lagay.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step1-content2":"Yeh ek decentralized digital currency hai: jise kisi bhi government ya central authority ke janib se na to jari kiya jata hai aur na hi control kiya jata hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-step1-title":"Bitcoin kia hota hai?","binance-academy-bitcoin-step2-content4":"3 January 2009 ko Bitcoin ka Genesis Block mine kiya gaya. Is ke code mein Satoshi ne ek saada magar nihayat taqatwar paigham shamil kiya:","binance-academy-bitcoin-step4-content2":"Jo pehla miner is maslay ko hal kar leta hai, woh naya block blockchain mein shamil karta hai aur inaam ke tor par naye bitcoins hasil karta hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-values-item4-title":"Decentralized hai","binance-academy-bitcoin-step1-content3":"Bitcoin aap ko ek global peer-to-peer network ke zariye digital paisa bhejne aur hasil karne ki sahulat deta hai.","binance-academy-bitcoin-start-now":"Abhi Shuru karein","binance-academy-bitcoin-step3-content4":"Har computer ke paas ledger ki apni local copy hoti hai. Agar Alice, Bob ko 1 BTC bhejti hai, to yeh transaction blockchain par record ho jati hai jise har koi dekh sakta hai, aur sab ki copy bhi us ke mutabiq update ho jati hai.","binance-academy-homepage-earn-bitcoin-title":"Apna Pehla Bitcoin Hasil karein","binance-academy-homepage-short-cuts-learn-btc":"BTC ke baray mein seekhein","binance-academy-homepage-earn-bitcoin-desc":"Crypto ki duniya mein naye hain? Yeh janein keh Bitcoin kaise kaam karta hai aur BTC hasil karne ke liye ek mukhtasar quiz mukammal karein — sirf naye users ke liye.","binance-academy-highlight-learn-and-discuss-description":"Binance Square par hamari crypto community ke sath seekhein aur guftagu karein! numayan hone aur inamat jeetne ka moqa hasil karein.","binance-academy-highlight-learn-and-discuss":"Seekhein aur Guftagu karein","binance-academy-developer-academy-api-trading":"API Trading","binance-academy-developer-academy-api-limits":"API Limits","binance-academy-developer-academy-api-keys":"API Keys","binance-academy-course-need-help":"Humare courses ya certificates ko samajhne mein madad chahiye?","binance-academy-course-find-answers":"FAQ mein jawabat talash karein","binance-academy-course-category-university-course":"University Course","binance-academy-course-category-specialization-course":"Specialization Course","binance-academy-course-skill-level-difficulty":"Difficulty","binance-academy-developer-academy-api-responses":"API jawabaat","binance-academy-course-tab-free-course":"Muft","binance-academy-course-tab-all-course":"Tamaam Courses","binance-academy-course-tab-paid-course":"Paid","binance-academy-course-tab-listed-project":"Listed Projects","binance-academy-footer-disclaimer":"Disclaimer: Ye content aap ke liye \"jesa hai\" ki bunyaad par sirf amoomi maloomat aur taleemi maqaasid ki gharz se pesh kiya giya hai, aur is mein kisi qisam ki numaindagi ya zamanat shamil nahi. Isse mali, qanooni ya deegar qisam ki professional advice nahi samjha jana chahiye, na he is ka maqsad kisi makhsoos product ya service ki khareedari ki tajweez dena hai. Aap ko chahiye keh zati mashwaray ke liye muta'alqa professional advisors se mashwara lein. Jahan ye content kisi third party contributor ki janib se pesh kiya jaye, barahe karam note karein keh wo khayalat us third party contributor ke hain, aur zaruri nahin keh wo Binance Academy ke mu'aqif ki akasi karte hon. Digital asset ki qeemtein gher mustahkum ho sakti hain. Aap ki sarmayakari ki value kam ya ziada ho sakti hai aur ho sakta hai keh aap ko apni lagai gai raqam wapis na milay. Aap ke saramayakari ke faislon ki mukammal zamadari aap par hai aur Binance Academy aap ko honay walay kisi bhi qisam ke nuqsanaat ke liye zimadar nahi hai. Mazeed maloomat ke liye, hamari \u003ca href=\"https://www.binance.com/terms\" class=\"disclaimer-link\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eIstemal ki Sharaait\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://www.binance.com/risk-warning\" class=\"disclaimer-link\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eKhatray ka Intibah\u003c/a\u003e aur \u003ca href=\"https://www.binance.com/academy/articles/disclaimer\" class=\"disclaimer-link\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBinance Academy ki Sharaait\u003c/a\u003e mulahiza karein.","binance-academy-switch-nft-to-pdf-modal-title":"NFT Certificate ko PDF Certificate mein tabdeel karein","binance-academy-switch-nft-to-pdf-certificate":"NFT Certificate ko PDF Certificate mein tabdeel karein","binance-academy-switch-nft-to-pdf-modal-desc":"Kia waqai aap NFT Certificate ko PDF Certificate mein tabdeel karna chahte hain? Tasdeeq ke baad PDF khudkaar tor par download ho jaye ga.","learn_and_earn_reward-empty":"Default: if Reward else empty","learn-and-earn-reward-empty":"Default: if Reward else empty.","test":"test"}},"initialTheme":"dark","isReferralApi":"false","courseMenu":[{"resourceKey":"Academy","name":"Academy","trackList":[{"resourceKey":"ai-unlocked-agents-and-skills","name":"Al Unlocked: Agents aur Skills"},{"resourceKey":"beginner-track","name":"Naye Seekhne wale Users ke liye Track"},{"resourceKey":"on-chain-analysis-for-beginners","name":"Naye Users ke liye On-Chain Analysis"}]},{"resourceKey":"Specialization-Course","name":"Specialization Course","trackList":[{"resourceKey":"introduction-to-edu-chain-open-campus","name":"EDU Chain aur Open Campus ka Taaruf"}]}],"homeNav":{"articles":[{"id":10524,"title":"AI Safety Best Practices","slug":"ai-safety-best-practices"},{"id":2247,"title":"What Is Bitcoin and How Does It Work?","slug":"what-is-bitcoin"},{"id":10548,"title":"AI Stock Trading: Bots, Tools, and Automation","slug":"ai-stock-trading-bots-tools-and-automation"}],"topics":[{"id":2,"title":"Trading","slug":"trading"},{"id":5,"title":"Technical Analysis","slug":"technical-analysis"},{"id":3,"title":"Crypto Basics","slug":"essentials"}]}},"e460":{"bitCoinPrice":{"bridge":"USDT","code":"BTC","symbol":"BTCUSDT","logoUrl":"https://bin.bnbstatic.com/image/admin_mgs_image_upload/20201110/87496d50-2408-43e1-ad4c-78b47b448a6a.png","price":"58402.87","priceChange":"199.78"}}}}},"pageData":{"shuviInitialState":{},"ssrData":{"lang":"ur-PK","pathPrefix":"/ur-PK","level2Domain":"binance.com","isRegionMode":false}},"basename":"/ur-PK","runtimeConfig":{"SITE_HOST":"https://www.binance.com","HOST_URL":"https://academy.binance.com","ASK_PU